      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Geekatplay Canvas - MiniMax H3 Image (local, 4K)\n\n1. Drop or paste images onto the canvas. **Inside the frame** they are part of the picture, **outside** they are references only.\n2. Draw with the pen (B). Strokes close together become one sketch.\n3. Right-click anywhere (or press N) to pin a note: *girl climbs the tree from this side*, *dress her in this suit*.\n4. Add an overall prompt below the canvas. Mention items as @image1, @sketch1; the canvas turns them into <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>.\n5. Pick the aspect ratio in the canvas toolbar, then Run.\n\n**Output size:** the canvas ratio at **Output megapixels**. The model works from 4 to 20 MP and is best around 16 MP; 8 MP is 4K (3840x2160 at 16:9). The canvas size (MP) does not change the output.\n\n**AI director** (on): a local vision model looks at the annotated canvas, the references and your notes and writes a description of the final picture. It goes first in the prompt, so a canvas without a written prompt still gets a full scene description. The result shows in **Prompt sent to MiniMax**. Switch it off to send only the compiled canvas prompt.\n\nMiniMax edits <Picture 1>, so the canvas does not send it the layout collage: positions and sketches reach it as words and through the director. One image filling the frame is the base image to edit.\n\n6 steps, cfg 1, euler / simple: the model is distilled for this schedule.\n\n**Models**\n- diffusion_models: [minimax_h3_image_pruned_int8_convrot](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_image_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) (21 GB)\n- vae: [minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- text_encoders: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors) (25 GB), [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) for the AI director (7 GB)\n\nThe same model files and sampler settings as ComfyUI's own MiniMax H3 Image template; everything runs locally."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Geekatplay Canvas - MiniMax H3 Image (local, 4K)\n\n1. Drop or paste images onto the canvas. **Inside the frame** they are part of the picture, **outside** they are references only.\n2. Draw with the pen (B). Strokes close together become one sketch.\n3. Right-click anywhere (or press N) to pin a note: *girl climbs the tree from this side*, *dress her in this suit*.\n4. Add an overall prompt below the canvas. Mention items as @image1, @sketch1; the canvas turns them into <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>.\n5. Pick the aspect ratio in the canvas toolbar, then Run.\n\n**Output size:** the canvas ratio at **Output megapixels**. The model works from 4 to 20 MP and is best around 16 MP; 8 MP is 4K (3840x2160 at 16:9). The canvas size (MP) does not change the output.\n\n**AI director** (on): a local vision model looks at the annotated canvas, the references and your notes and writes a description of the final picture. It goes first in the prompt, so a canvas without a written prompt still gets a full scene description. The result shows in **Prompt sent to MiniMax**. Switch it off to send only the compiled canvas prompt.\n\nMiniMax edits <Picture 1>, so the canvas does not send it the layout collage: positions and sketches reach it as words and through the director. One image filling the frame is the base image to edit.\n\n6 steps, cfg 1, euler / simple: the model is distilled for this schedule.\n\n**Models**\n- diffusion_models: [minimax_h3_image_pruned_int8_convrot](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_image_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) (21 GB)\n- vae: [minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- text_encoders: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors) (25 GB), [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) for the AI director (7 GB)\n\nThe same model files and sampler settings as ComfyUI's own MiniMax H3 Image template; everything runs locally."
      },
